This patch adds few improvements to the SBI PMU extension in order to
minimize the traps while accessing hpmcounters in VS mode & starting
multiple counter with an initial value at the same time.

The PoC is available here:
https://github.com/atishp04/linux/tree/kvm_perf_snapshot_rfc

This patch can also be found here:
https://github.com/atishp04/riscv-sbi-doc/tree/pmu_snapshot_v3

Changes from v2->v3:
1. Removed all tabs & trailing white space characters.
2. All lines are withing 80 character limit as well.

Changes from v1->v2:
1. Addressed all the comments and change the function names to align
   the spec overall. 

